{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#feature-1","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 的功能「视频证据分析」：按 BV 号或 B 站链接获取带时间戳的抽样画面、字幕或本地转写与 OCR 文本，作为图片附件和文字证据交给当前 DSH 视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:187-191","bv.py:854-896"]}
{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#feature-2","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 的功能「口播文字摘要」：调用字幕摘要工具获取官方字幕或本地 ASR 转写文本，供当前对话模型总结；此动作跳过视频下载、抽帧和独立模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:193-202","bv.py:430-474","bv.py:628-650"]}
{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#feature-3","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 的功能「指定区间复查」：用户提供 start 和 end 秒数后，可聚焦视频片段并用单帧布局查看局部细节，也能设置问题来辅助相关画面筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:113-120","bv.py:623-626","bv.py:715-742"]}
{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#feature-4","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 的功能「独立模型分析」：选择 run 动作后，将整理出的字幕或转写、OCR 与选中画面发给配置的 DeepSeek API，并返回模型回答；超过文本预算时分块处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["bv.py:903-920","bv.py:938-972"]}
{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#feature-5","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 的功能「预算与取帧计划」：plan 使用视频证据处理流程生成选帧、文本覆盖和输入预算报告，帮助用户查看预计证据范围；它不会据此声称完整观看每一帧。","source":"generated","evidence":["bv.py:854-896","bv.py:1003-1050"]}
{"unit_id":"icyaaaww__dsh-bili-vision#caveat-1","repo":"icyaaaww/dsh-bili-vision","commit":"5048affdf38e7b0a519425cb313bb23d956a5f22","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"bili-vision 使用时间采样画面，采样间隔内的短暂事件可能遗漏；对关键细节可指定 start/end 缩小范围并以单帧布局复查。","source":"generated","evidence":["bv.py:715-742","README.md:87-94"]}
